DUSD::setMinterStatus
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── given caller is owner
│   ├── when setting minter status to true for new address
│   │   ├── it should set allowedMinter mapping to true
│   │   └── it should emit SetMinterStatus event
│   ├── when setting minter status to false for existing minter
│   │   ├── it should set allowedMinter mapping to false
│   │   └── it should emit SetMinterStatus event
│   ├── when setting same status (true to true)
│   │   ├── it should update the mapping
│   │   └── it should emit SetMinterStatus event
│   └── when setting same status (false to false)
│       ├── it should update the mapping
│       └── it should emit SetMinterStatus event
